oxed (0.1.0~dev1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * OxCaml bootstrap on macOS arm64 (opam 2.6.1) failed while
    installing Dune 3.23.1 under oxcaml-compiler 5.4.0-ox9:
    `./_boot/dune.exe install ...` exited 139 (SIGSEGV).
  * Reproduce under LLDB: EXC_BAD_ACCESS at address 0x0 from
    caml_unix_pipe (pipe_unix.c:27). `dune.exe --version` worked.
  * Confirm SDK mismatch: macOS 26.7.1 was using macOS 27.0 SDK;
    `nm -m "$dune"` showed weak external _pipe2 and _dup3.
  * Identified installed MacOSX26.5.sdk. Proposed rebuilding with:
    `export SDKROOT=/Library/Developer/CommandLineTools/SDKs/MacOSX26.5.sdk`
    `export MACOSX_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET=26.0`
  * Subsequent opam retry also reported Sys_error("No such file or
    directory"); deleted build-directory cwd was a hypothesis, not
    a verified cause. Exact reinstall sequence was not recorded here.
  * Do not confuse a successful native build with runtime ABI safety.

 -- EAX <info@dst9.org>  Wed, 18 Nov 2026 00:00:00 -0500

oxed (0.0.1~dev1) UNRELEASED; urgency=low

  * Seed documentation-first Git repository: README.md, SPEC.md,
    CHANGELOG.md, and .gitignore; no prewritten editor source.
  * Bootstrap commands for manual transcription:
    `unzip bootstrap-oxed.zip`; `git clone ./bootstrap-oxed oxed`;
    `cd oxed`; `git status --short --branch`.
  * Host prerequisites on macOS: `brew install opam autoconf pkg-config`.
    Other host-specific instructions were originally documented for
    Arch Linux and Ubuntu 24.04; execute only the relevant branch.
  * Compiler setup: `opam init`; `opam update --all`;
    `opam switch create oxcaml oxcaml-compiler --repos
    ox=git+https://github.com/oxcaml/opam-repository.git,default`;
    `eval "$(opam env --switch=oxcaml --set-switch)"`.
  * Library setup: `opam install dune ocamlfind base core core_unix
    zed lambda-term lwt`; defer Tree-sitter and LSP dependencies.
  * Development rule: type every source line, record the actual
    compiler diagnostic, fix one contract, rebuild, and commit.
  * The commands above originated as setup instructions; they were
    not all independently verified when the seed was created.

 -- EAX <info@dst9.org>  Wed, 18 Nov 2026 00:00:00 -0500
